{"sha": "5e84e433bbd89960e0dde4850a5b1183dcdecf5c3dcd817619ebad95ccb841ac", "body": ["\\section{真实热机循环}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[奥托循环]\\label{prop:b1:heat-engines:otto}", "\\index{奥托循环}\\index{压缩比}", "理想化汽油机使空气（$\\gamma$）经历如下循环：$1 \\to 2$", "从 $V_1$ 到 $V_2$ 的绝热压缩（\\emph{压缩比}", "$r = V_1/V_2$）；$2 \\to 3$ 等容加热（燃烧）；$3 \\to 4$", "绝热膨胀回到 $V_1$；$4 \\to 1$ 等容降温（", "排气）。其效率为", "\\[", "\\eta_{\\text{奥托}} = 1 - \\frac{1}{r^{\\gamma-1}} .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "仅在等容线上发生热交换：$Q_h = nC_{V,m}(T_3 - T_2)$，且", "$Q_c = nC_{V,m}(T_1 - T_4)$。在绝热线上 $TV^{\\gamma-1}$ 为常量：", "$T_2 = T_1r^{\\gamma-1}$，$T_3 = T_4r^{\\gamma-1}$，故 $T_3 - T_2 =", "(T_4 - T_1)r^{\\gamma-1}$，于是", "$\\eta = 1 + Q_c/Q_h = 1 - (T_4 - T_1)/(T_3 - T_2) = 1 - r^{1-\\gamma}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[汽油机的数值]\\label{ex:b1:heat-engines:ottonumbers}", "$r = 9$，$\\gamma = 1.4$：$9^{0.4} = 2.41$，$\\eta = 0.58$。实际汽油机", "的效率约为 $0.30$：燃烧并非瞬时完成，气体", "在 \\qty{2500}{K} 时并非理想气体，热量漏向壁面，摩擦与泵气", "各占一份。提高 $r$ 有帮助 --- 直到空气与燃料的混合物在压缩末期", "自行点燃（爆震）；柴油机", "把这一缺陷变为其工作原理。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[狄塞尔循环]\\label{prop:b1:heat-engines:diesel}", "\\index{狄塞尔循环}", "将奥托循环中的等容加热换为等压加热，自", "$V_2$ 至 $V_3 = \\rho V_2$（\\emph{截止比} $\\rho > 1$）：燃料喷入", "已因压缩比 $r$ 为 $15$ 至 $22$ 而升温的空气中，", "随即燃烧。于是", "\\[", "\\eta_{\\text{狄塞尔}} = 1 - \\frac{1}{r^{\\gamma-1}}\\,\\frac{\\rho^{\\gamma} - 1}{\\gamma(\\rho - 1)} ,", "\\]", "在相同 $r$ 下小于奥托值，但需在大得多的 $r$ 下方能达到，", "因而实际上效率更高（大型发动机为 $0.40$ 至 $0.45$）。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$Q_h = nC_{P,m}(T_3 - T_2)$，$Q_c = nC_{V,m}(T_1 - T_4)$，故 $\\eta = 1 -", "(T_4 - T_1)/[\\gamma(T_3 - T_2)]$。由 $T_2 = T_1r^{\\gamma-1}$，$T_3 =", "\\rho T_2$，并由绝热线 $3 \\to 4$（$V_4 = V_1 = rV_2$）得 $T_4 =", "T_3(V_3/V_4)^{\\gamma-1} = \\rho T_1 r^{\\gamma-1}(\\rho/r)^{\\gamma-1} = T_1\\rho^{\\gamma}$：", "$\\eta = 1 - (\\rho^\\gamma - 1)/[\\gamma r^{\\gamma-1}(\\rho - 1)]$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, width=7.2cm, height=5.6cm,", "    xlabel={$V$}, ylabel={$P$}, xmin=0, xmax=5.6, ymin=0, ymax=15.5, clip=false,", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.06)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick={1,4}, xticklabels={$V_2$,$V_1$}, ytick=\\empty, samples=60]", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=1:4] {x^(-1.4)*6.96};", "  \\addplot[omThm, very thick] coordinates {(1,6.96) (1,13.9)};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=1:4] {13.9*x^(-1.4)};", "  \\addplot[omDef, very thick] coordinates {(4,2.0) (4,1)};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, anchor=north east] at (axis cs:3.95,0.95) {$1$};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, anchor=east] at (axis cs:0.9,6.96) {$2$};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:1.05,13.9) {$3$};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:4.05,2.1) {$4$};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omThm, anchor=west] at (axis cs:1.15,10.5) {$Q_h$（燃烧）};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omDef, anchor=west] at (axis cs:4.15,1.0) {$Q_c$（排气）};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, thick] (axis cs:2.0,5.25) -- (axis cs:2.2,4.6);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, thick] (axis cs:2.2,2.33) -- (axis cs:2.0,2.65);", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omProp, anchor=west] (lblexp) at (axis cs:2.9,6.4) {膨胀};", "  \\draw[omProp, -Stealth] (lblexp.west) -- (axis cs:2.55,3.9);", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omProp, anchor=west] (lblcomp) at (axis cs:4.4,4.6) {压缩};", "  \\draw[omProp, -Stealth] (lblcomp.west) -- (axis cs:3.3,1.45);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\hfill", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, width=6.6cm, height=5.6cm,", "    xlabel={$r$}, ylabel={$\\eta$}, xmin=0, xmax=22, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.12)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick={5,10,15,20}, ytick={0.2,0.4,0.6,0.8,1}, samples=80]", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=1:22] {1-x^(-0.4)} node[pos=0.55, above, font=\\footnotesize] {奥托，$\\gamma = 1.4$};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=1.5:22] {1-(2^1.4-1)/(1.4*x^0.4*(2-1))} node[pos=0.415, below right, font=\\footnotesize, align=left] {狄塞尔，\\\\ $\\rho = 2$};", "  \\addplot[omProp, dashed, thick] coordinates {(9,0) (9,0.585)};", "  \\addplot[omProp, dashed, thick] coordinates {(18,0) (18,0.632)};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左图：克拉珀龙图中的奥托循环（取 $r = 4$）：两条绝热线和两条等容线；", "热量在上止点进入，", "随排气排出。右图：理想效率随压缩比的变化；", "虚线标出汽油机（$r = 9$）与", "柴油机（$r = 18$，$\\rho = 2$）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[斯特林循环与回热器]\\label{prop:b1:heat-engines:stirling}", "\\index{斯特林循环}\\index{回热器}", "两条等温线（$T_c$, $T_h$）由两条等容线相连。等容段的热量", "$\\pm nC_{V,m}(T_h - T_c)$，二者大小相等、方向相反；若将其", "储存于降温段的\\emph{回热器}（一种供气体流经的多孔物质）中，", "并在升温段送回，则只有等温线", "与热源交换热量，且 $\\eta = 1 - T_c/T_h$：斯特林热机", "除循环形状之外，它就是一台卡诺热机。无回热器时，", "等容段的热量必须取自热源，且", "$\\eta = \\dfrac{nR(T_h - T_c)\\ln(V_1/V_2)}{nRT_h\\ln(V_1/V_2) + nC_{V,m}(T_h - T_c)}$，", "其值明显更小（见\\cref{exo:b1:heat-engines:8}）。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在等温线上 $Q_h = nRT_h\\ln(V_1/V_2)$，$Q_c = -nRT_c\\ln(V_1/V_2)$，故", "$-W = Q_h + Q_c + 0$，待等容段热量相消后，除以各情形下", "实际从热源吸取的热量。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}